// The positive control for the pack fix of 2026-11-20: `Gradient<F>` is written
// `<...WithOf<F>> (...ParamsOf<F>) => ...`, and both packs are settled when the alias is
// instantiated.
//
//   `WithOf<F>` with one member  -> ONE `with` parameter, and a call passes one angle-bracket value
//   `WithOf<F>` with no member   -> NO `with` parameter, in the type and in the call
//
// The first line was refused before the fix: the rest slot was put back *beside* the member the
// substitution had already written, so the type said one parameter, `StaticFuncTypeResolver` counted
// the slot away and every call came out one argument short --
//
//     '<__pack_0_0: float> () => float' cannot be called with argument types: <> (float)
//
// -- which is what stopped the second-order nest and every `grad` call in the tree. The language
// the rule: an empty rest pack is a value in the body (an empty tuple) and
// enters neither the parameter list nor the function type; a pack whose members are known is those
// members, as ordinary parameters.
//
// The two types are also compared by `is_same`, so the shape is pinned and not only the call.
import { WithOf, ParamsOf, Gradient, is_same } from types

type GradOf<F> = <...WithOf<F>>(...ParamsOf<F>) => float

func main() => int sync {
    // One member: the pack is the single `with` parameter, and the call gives one value.
    let one: GradOf<<x: float>() => float> = func <w>() {
        w * w
    }
    // No member: the pack is nothing, so the type has no `with` parameter and the call gives none.
    let none: GradOf<() => float> = func () {
        5.0
    }
    let a = one<3.0>()
    let b = none()
    println('with_pack_lambda one={} none={}'->format<a, b>)
    // The shape itself: the alias over a one-member pack is the alias over a written `<x: float>`,
    // and the alias over an empty pack has no `with` list at all.
    let sameOne = is_same::<GradOf<<x: float>() => float>, <w: float>() => float>()
    let sameNone = is_same::<GradOf<() => float>, () => float>()
    println('with_pack_lambda same_one={} same_none={}'->format<sameOne, sameNone>)
    return 0
}
